### Sign up a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@campuspool.pk",
  "phone": "+92 300 1112222",
  "password": "test123"
}

### Log in with that user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "email": "test@campuspool.pk",
  "password": "test123"
}

### Log in with a seeded demo user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ayesha@campuspool.pk",
  "password": "demo123"
}

### Wrong password — should fail
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@campuspool.pk",
  "password": "WRONGPASS"
}

### my rides — needs a token
GET http://localhost:3000/api/rides/mine
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjY1MmMyMTlhLWMwYTctNGY5Mi1iMjg1LTkxNjE4Mzg2YjIwZSIsImlzX2FkbWluIjpmYWxzZSwiaWF0IjoxNzg2NjM4OTI4LCJleHAiOjE3ODcyNDM3Mjh9.eSSIYl2ii0eccGuwWRmaYg0SAnT6-3_bl_MN2tLlBOA

### my rides — no token, should 401
GET http://localhost:3000/api/rides/mine

